00:02:34.256 --> 00:02:36.785
And my requests as well to create this.

00:02:36.785 --> 00:02:40.517
I wanted to be surrounded
by successful people

00:02:40.517 --> 00:02:41.752
on a daily basis.

00:02:41.752 --> 00:02:44.018
That's the thesis of this channel.

00:02:44.018 --> 00:02:46.004
I wanted to be surrounded by success

00:02:46.004 --> 00:02:49.840
and use that to push me into
a more powerful direction

00:02:49.840 --> 00:02:51.240
forward.

00:02:51.240 --> 00:02:53.762
