00:03:12.202 --> 00:03:13.805
I wanted that process to be simpler.

00:03:13.805 --> 00:03:15.979
I wanted to just turn on
YouTube and there's a video.

00:03:15.979 --> 00:03:19.004
I click play, I get
inspired, I learn something,

00:03:19.004 --> 00:03:20.500
and I wanted to be consistent.

00:03:20.500 --> 00:03:22.198
I don't watch the same video 100 times

00:03:22.198 --> 00:03:24.496
because the impact would wear out.

00:03:24.496 --> 00:03:27.535
So this channel was designed for me,

00:03:27.535 --> 00:03:30.475
and I'm happy to share it with you guys.

00:03:30.475 --> 00:03:32.810
And we have this relationship
where it's for both of us

00:03:32.810 --> 00:03:34.990
